{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02971","headline":"登郡城南楼 · 张九龄","name":"登郡城南楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闭阁幸无事，登楼聊永日。\n云霞千里开，洲渚万形出。\n澹澹澄江漫，飞飞度鸟疾。\n邑人半舻舰，津树多枫橘。\n感别时已屡，凭眺情非一。\n远怀不我同，孤兴与谁悉。\n平生本单绪，邂逅承优秩。\n谬忝爲邦寄，多慙理人术。\n驽铅虽自勉，仓廪素非实。\n陈力倘无効，谢病从芝术。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02971.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02971","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}